# There are no generated pages (D-405): the record is data/*.csv (and data/inbox/*.csv),
# and the Rx7 app shows it. Anything else a view layer ever produces is ignored here so it
# can never be committed and never be mistaken for the record.
*.html
*.svg
*.stamp
VIEW.*
MANUAL.*
view.json
outputs/
!99-ARCHIVE/**/*.html
!99-ARCHIVE/**/*.svg
!01-REFERENCE/**/*.html
# The harness-leg drawings (D-385) are generated like DECISIONS.md and committed like it:
# they are the bench copy and the car record. Only this folder is excepted.
!02-PROJECTS/00-electrical/00-design/diagrams/**/*.svg

# Rendered page names from v2 and v3 - never regenerate these (D-405).
DESIGN.md
SHOPPING-LIST.md
INSTALL.md
QUESTIONS.md
LOG.md
WIRE-TABLES.md
ANSWERS.md
DECISIONS.md
BLOCKS.md
TODO.md
PICKS.md
SPEC.md
!99-ARCHIVE/**

# Scratch
__pycache__/
*.py[co]
*.tmp
*.typed-in.bak

# IDE and OS state
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Built binaries (Linux has no extension to match, so each one is named)
*.exe
*.o
*.obj
02-PROJECTS/00-electrical/00-design/firmware/icu_sim/sim
02-PROJECTS/00-electrical/00-design/firmware/tests/test
02-PROJECTS/00-electrical/00-design/firmware/tests/test_bt817
02-PROJECTS/00-electrical/00-design/firmware/tests/test_dcu

# KiCad, under 02-PROJECTS/00-electrical/00-design/cad/ only. That folder is not an area and
# not the view layer (see its README): it is a CAD tool drawing one board. The exported
# schematic SVG is the exception to the *.svg rule above, because a hardware change is
# unreviewable without a picture - an S-expression diff of coordinate tuples is not one.
!02-PROJECTS/00-electrical/00-design/cad/**/*.svg
*.kicad_prl
*-backups/
*.kicad_sch-bak
*.kicad_pcb-bak
_autosave-*
fp-info-cache
*-erc.rpt
*-drc.rpt
02-PROJECTS/00-electrical/00-design/cad/**/*.pdf
02-PROJECTS/00-electrical/00-design/cad/**/*.net
02-PROJECTS/00-electrical/00-design/cad/**/net.txt
02-PROJECTS/00-electrical/00-design/firmware/tests/test_radio
02-PROJECTS/00-electrical/00-design/firmware/icu_sim/renders/

# KiCad 10's local history and lock files (per machine, never versioned)
02-PROJECTS/00-electrical/00-design/cad/**/.history/
02-PROJECTS/00-electrical/00-design/cad/**/~*.lck

# The Rx7 app (02-PROJECTS/10-gui/app) is source code: its own HTML and SVG are tracked.
# Its dependencies and build output are not.
!02-PROJECTS/10-gui/app/**/*.html
!02-PROJECTS/10-gui/app/**/*.svg
02-PROJECTS/10-gui/app/node_modules/
02-PROJECTS/10-gui/app/dist/
02-PROJECTS/10-gui/app/build/
02-PROJECTS/10-gui/app/test-results/
02-PROJECTS/10-gui/app/playwright-report/
02-PROJECTS/10-gui/app/src-tauri/target/
02-PROJECTS/10-gui/app/src-tauri/gen/android/**/build/
02-PROJECTS/10-gui/app/src-tauri/gen/android/.gradle/
02-PROJECTS/10-gui/app/public/pyodide/
02-PROJECTS/10-gui/app/public/core/
*.keystore
*.jks
keystore.properties
